{"artifact_links": ["https://simonwillison.net/2026/Sep/24/datasette"], "author_or_org": null, "canonical_url": "https://simonwillison.net/2026/Sep/24/datasette", "collection_method": "rss_atom", "confidence": "high", "content_hash": "5e619ceebe85498e", "dedup_key": "rss-guid:simonwillison-blog:https://simonwillison.net/2026/Sep/24/datasette/", "event_id": "event_87f8ebc8c6d39ef4", "evidence_type": "supported_fact", "excerpt": "<p><strong>Release:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/simonw/datasette/releases/tag/1.0a41\">datasette 1.0a41</a></p>\n        <p>Alec Garcia added <a href=\"https://docs.datasette.io/en/latest/internals.html#internals-telemetry\">support for OpenTelemetry</a> to Datasette in this release.</p>\n<p>I've also refactored all of Datasette's modal dialogs to a single Web Component, which is now <a href=\"https://docs.datasette.io/en/latest/javascript_plugins.html#javascript-plugins-modals\">documented for other plugins to use</a>.</p>\n    \n    \n        <p>Tags: <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/javascript\">javascript</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/datasette\">datasette</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/web-components\">web-components</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/alex-garcia\">alex-garcia</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/opentelemetry\">opentelemetry</a></p>", "identifiers": {}, "inferred_entities": [], "item_type": "rss_atom_item", "novelty_score": 0.0, "published_at": "2026-09-24T19:15:23+00:00", "ranking_explanation": "", "raw_metadata": {}, "relevance_score": 0.0, "retrieved_at": "2026-09-24T22:11:05Z", "source_id": "simonwillison-blog", "source_name": "Simon Willison's Weblog", "source_native_id": "https://simonwillison.net/2026/Sep/24/datasette/", "source_policy": "public_official", "source_type": "primary_artifact", "summary_hint": "<p><strong>Release:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/simonw/datasette/releases/tag/1.0a41\">datasette 1.0a41</a></p>\n        <p>Alec Garcia added <a href=\"https://docs.datasette.io/en/latest/internals.html#internals-telemetry\">support for OpenTelemetry</a> to Datasette in this release.</p>\n<p>I've also refactored all of Datasette's modal dialogs to a single Web Component, which is now <a href=\"https://docs.datasette.io/en/latest/javascript_plugins.html#javascript-plugins-modals\">documented for other plugins to use</a>.</p>\n    \n    \n        <p>Tags: <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/javascript\">javascript</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/datasette\">datasette</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/web-components\">web-components</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/alex-garcia\">alex-garcia</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/opentelemetry\">opentelemetry</a></p>", "title": "datasette 1.0a41", "topics": ["topic_datasette-0a41"], "updated_at": null}
